2.4 Vehicle subsystems modelling

For a complete vehicle model, the multibody formalism is augmented by other subsystems: powertrain, cruise control, wheels, brakes, tyres, steering and aerodynamic forces. Each of the subsystem models is coupled to the RTRD code and computations are completed for each of them at each simulation time step. This section describes the models of each subsystem for the 1997 Jeep Cherokee Sport.

2.4.1 Powertrain

